  - tier: 2
    recommendedGearScore: 30
    minimumGearScore: 15
    wardLevelNeeded: 1
    enemyHealth: 1.729
    enemyPower: 1.6
    enemyDensity: 1.15
    loot: 1.25
    dropsUpToTier: 0
    briefing: Wolves pounce from a distance and bog things spit in volleys. Root Guardians wake, Moss Shamans call them on. Iron, deepstone and elderwood lie deeper in.
    eliteCount: {x: 1, y: 2}
    eliteAffixes: 1
    hunterEliteChance: 0
    eliteRelicChance: 0.05
    eliteLoot:
      entries: []
  - tier: 3
    recommendedGearScore: 50
    minimumGearScore: 30
    wardLevelNeeded: 2
    enemyHealth: 2.934
    enemyPower: 2.85
    enemyDensity: 1.3
    loot: 1.5
    dropsUpToTier: 0
    briefing: 'The dead walk: Draugs among the trees. Boars trample, Guardians slam the ground and the great troll charges. Moonsilver can be found here.'
    eliteCount: {x: 2, y: 3}
    eliteAffixes: 1
    hunterEliteChance: 0.15
    eliteRelicChance: 0.1
    eliteLoot:
      entries: []
  - tier: 4
    recommendedGearScore: 70
    minimumGearScore: 45
    wardLevelNeeded: 3
    enemyHealth: 3.2
    enemyPower: 5.142
    enemyDensity: 1.45
    loot: 1.8
    dropsUpToTier: 0
    briefing: The woods at their worst. Draugs rally with a war cry, Guardians call up roots and the great troll calls its kin. Its Trollstone is worth taking.
    eliteCount: {x: 3, y: 4}
    eliteAffixes: 2
    hunterEliteChance: 0.25
    eliteRelicChance: 0.15
    eliteLoot:
      entries: []
  - tier: 5
    recommendedGearScore: 109
    minimumGearScore: 65
    wardLevelNeeded: 4
    enemyHealth: 4.2
    enemyPower: 6.953
    enemyDensity: 1.6
    loot: 2.1
    dropsUpToTier: 0
    briefing: 'The deepest the portal reaches: everything here has fed on the blight a long while. Trollstone gear, and the will to use it.'
    eliteCount: {x: 4, y: 5}
    eliteAffixes: 2
    hunterEliteChance: 0.25
    eliteRelicChance: 0.15
    eliteLoot:
      entries: []
